# Growth OS

Personal growth system. The work IS the practice.

## Home

- Repo: `$HOME/Documents/growth-os` (override with `$GROWTH_OS_HOME`)
- Config: `$GROWTH_OS_HOME/config.json` — read before any vault write
- Workflows: `$GROWTH_OS_HOME/workflows/`

## Commands (Cursor)

| Trigger | Skill / command |
|---------|-----------------|
| Before coding | `growth-premortem` or `/growth-premortem` |
| After ticket done | `growth-reflect` or `/growth-reflect` |
| Expand a pattern | `growth-concept` or `/growth-concept` |
| Sprint end | `growth-weekly` or `/growth-weekly` |
| First-time setup | `growth-onboard` or `/growth-onboard` |

When the user invokes a growth workflow, load the matching skill and follow its workflow file end-to-end.

## Separation

Growth OS builds the engineer; the codebase builds the software. Do not mix vault writes into unrelated coding tasks unless the user explicitly asks.
